          "kicker": "SEVENS PARTNERSHIP",
          "heading": "Fiji Rugby partners with Coca-Cola to launch commemorative sevens cans",
          "body": "Fiji Rugby has partnered with Coca-Cola Europacific Partners to launch limited-edition collectable cans and bottles celebrating the Fiji Airways Men’s 7s team. Unveiled at Albert Park in Suva, the commemorative packs feature eight iconic moments from the 2025 Hong Kong and Singapore tournaments. Fiji Rugby Commercial Director Tevita Tuiloa welcomed the campaign, stating, \"This is more than the launch of a new product.\" The initiative aims to connect the country's passion for the sport with community inspiration."
