          "heading": "England hooker Jamie Blamire starts for Leicester Tigers in Slater Cup return",
          "body": "England hooker Jamie Blamire will return to the Leicester Tigers starting line-up for Friday’s Slater Cup clash with Gloucester at Welford Road. Blamire is one of five changes made by coach Geoff Parling after recovering from injury to join fellow internationals Joe Heyes and Freddie Steward in the XV. Captain Jack van Poortvliet also starts, though Adam Radwan is rotated to the replacements. For the visitors, England centre Will Joseph retains his midfield spot in a Gloucester side currently sitting top of the table."
