          "heading": "Bordeaux-Begles claim status as England greats snub Super Rugby giants",
          "body": "Bordeaux-Begles have been positioned as a standard-setter for elite club rugby following a critical assessment of the sport's global landscape by England internationals Dan Cole and Ben Youngs. While discussing the current hierarchy of professional teams, the pair excluded Super Rugby sides from their top 10 rankings. This perspective underlines the growing domestic influence of the Top 14, where Bordeaux-Begles currently hold the distinction of being the reigning double-winning champions of the Investec Champions Cup."
