          "body": "Argentina showcased their attacking potential in the Nations Championship by securing a 35-21 victory over Wales. Despite a defeat to Scotland in the tournament opener, the Pumas recovered to brush aside the Welsh challenge in San Juan. The result highlighted a clinical side that scored five tries, effectively halting a mini-revival from the visitors. The win offers a boost to the squad as they continue their campaign, having also navigated a testing loss to England during the competition."
