          "heading": "Isaac Henry replaces Hunter Paisami as Wallabies face All Blacks away",
          "body": "Les Kiss has named a settled starting side for the Bledisloe Cup opener at Eden Park, with Isaac Henry called up to start at outside centre. Henry’s inclusion is the only change to the XV that defeated South Africa in Perth, as Len Ikitau shifts to inside centre to cover for the suspended Hunter Paisami. Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii has been retained on the wing to maintain back-three consistency. \"Keeping consistency in the starting side gives us a solid foundation,\" noted Kiss."
